OL,3,AArgentine leader says oil firms working
OL,4,Aoff Falklands face sanctions
OL,5,
OL,6,FArgentina's President Javier Milei has
OL,7,Fsaid he will sanction oil companies
OL,8,Fworking off the Falklands as he
OL,9,Freiterated the country's claim on the
OL,10,FBritish overseas territory in the
OL,11,Fsouth-west Atlantic Ocean.
OL,13,FIn a national address, Milei said the
OL,14,F"winds of change" favoured Argentina's
OL,15,Fclaim to the Falklands, pointing to
OL,16,FWashington's readiness to review its
OL,17,Fneutrality on the dispute.
OL,19,FMilei said the Sea Lion oilfield, where
OL,20,Fa British and an Israeli firm are due
OL,21,Fto begin exploration work, was a "clear
OL,22,Fand present danger".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
