OL,3,AArgentine leader says oil firms working
OL,4,Aoff Falklands face sanctions
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 40 years after the armed
OL,7,Fconflict over the territory, the
OL,8,Fsovereignty of the archipelago remains
OL,9,Fhotly disputed between Britain and
OL,10,FArgentina.
